    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "thr", "x": 1520, "y": 150, "width": 740, "height": 300,
      "strokeColor": "#dc2626", "backgroundColor": "#fef2f2", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 180065, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 180066, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "roundness": {"type": 3} },
    { "type": "text", "id": "thr_t", "x": 1544, "y": 168, "width": 696, "height": 264,
      "text": "The repetition threshold depends on the tools\n\n  every tool IsReadOnly     3 repeats allowed\n  any tool mutates          1 repeat allowed\n\nRe-reading a file can be legitimate exploration.\nRepeating a write with identical arguments cannot.\n\nIsReadOnly defaults to false on both ITool and\nLlmTool, so a tool you did not mark gets the strict\nthreshold. That is the safe default, but it means an\nhonestly read-only tool you forgot to flag will be\ncut off sooner than it should be.\n\nComparison is a set of normalised call keys, so\nreordering the same calls does not dodge the guard.",
      "originalText": "The repetition threshold depends on the tools\n\n  every tool IsReadOnly     3 repeats allowed\n  any tool mutates          1 repeat allowed\n\nRe-reading a file can be legitimate exploration.\nRepeating a write with identical arguments cannot.\n\nIsReadOnly defaults to false on both ITool and\nLlmTool, so a tool you did not mark gets the strict\nthreshold. That is the safe default, but it means an\nhonestly read-only tool you forgot to flag will be\ncut off sooner than it should be.\n\nComparison is a set of normalised call keys, so\nreordering the same calls does not dodge the guard.",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 180067, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 180068, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "disp", "x": 1520, "y": 480, "width": 740, "height": 200,
      "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "#eff6ff", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 180069, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 180070, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "roundness": {"type": 3} },
    { "type": "text", "id": "disp_t", "x": 1544, "y": 498, "width": 696, "height": 164,
      "text": "How a call reaches your code\n\nThe step matches each requested call against its\nTools by Name, ignoring case, and runs them one\nafter another  -  never concurrently.\n\nLlmTool wraps yours in traces, metrics and events.\nA bare ITool is run as-is: nothing is observed\nunless you emit it yourself.",
      "originalText": "How a call reaches your code\n\nThe step matches each requested call against its\nTools by Name, ignoring case, and runs them one\nafter another  -  never concurrently.\n\nLlmTool wraps yours in traces, metrics and events.\nA bare ITool is run as-is: nothing is observed\nunless you emit it yourself.",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 180071, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 180072, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "cmp", "x": 1520, "y": 710, "width": 740, "height": 196,
      "strokeColor": "#b45309", "backgroundColor": "#fffbeb", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 180073, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 180074, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "roundness": {"type": 3} },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cmp_t", "x": 1544, "y": 728, "width": 696, "height": 160,
      "text": "Two guards, two very different exits\n\nMaxToolIterations (default 5) throws. It is a\nbackstop for a genuine runaway, and it surfaces\nas a fatal error.\n\nThe repetition guard does not throw. It hands the\nmodel a final answer explaining the cut-off, so the\npipeline keeps going with a usable result.",
      "originalText": "Two guards, two very different exits\n\nMaxToolIterations (default 5) throws. It is a\nbackstop for a genuine runaway, and it surfaces\nas a fatal error.\n\nThe repetition guard does not throw. It hands the\nmodel a final answer explaining the cut-off, so the\npipeline keeps going with a usable result.",
